 "input": "trial site ops at the hospital (research nurse view). study gets HRA approval and local capacity confirmation before we can open. screening: potential participants found from clinic lists, checked against the eligibility criteria in the protocol. informed consent taken by a delegated doctor or nurse (delegation log says who can do what). randomisation through the sponsor's online system. study visits follow the visit schedule in the protocol, data entered into the eCRF. adverse events reported to the sponsor within set times, serious ones within 24h. investigational drug from pharmacy, accountability log kept. monitor from the sponsor visits to check eCRF against source notes.",
